  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien gangster-film brotherhood anthem with a cinematic hybrid score, half-time feel. Cellos and double basses in a low eighth-note ostinato; a taiko-style tom ensemble on the downbeats; overdriven rhythm-guitar power chords in the choruses only; an erhu countermelody in the instrumental break; a deep sub-bass layered under the kick. Wide and heavy, toms and strings filling the room, the lead vocal dry and forward. Gravelly male baritone in chest voice, the first line spoken like an oath, a stack of low male voices doubling every chorus line. 88 BPM, D minor. Straight-faced loyalty with a grin. No weeping ballad delivery, no trap hi-hats, no autotune, no rap, no piano ballad, no metal screams.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n半暝十二點 熱炒店 酒矸排一列\n阿雄放落箸 講伊明仔載欲搬厝\n無請工人 干焦借一台發財仔\n四个查埔人 煞攏恬去\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n酒杯 舉懸懸\n講一句 算一句\n\n[Chorus]\n透早六點 樓跤見\n一个嘛袂使欠\n冊櫥咱扛 眠床咱抬\n兄弟 講話算話\n\n[Verse]\n五點五十 天猶未光\n阿明穿拖鞋 喙內猶有酒味\n阿財紮一袋 燒燙燙的饅頭\n阿德夜班落班 直接趕來\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n無人喝一聲忝\n干焦拍一下 肩胛頭\n\n[Chorus]\n透早六點 樓跤見\n四个攏有到\n冊櫥咱扛 眠床咱抬\n五樓 行十二逝\n\n[Bridge]\n按摩椅 卡佇樓梯轉角\n四个人 喝一二三\n阿雄 共壁挵一空\n伊講 押金免想矣\n\n[Chorus]\n透早六點 樓跤見\n四个攏有到\n冊櫥咱扛 眠床咱抬\n後擺換你 阮嘛來\n\n[Outro]\n十點 新厝地板 坐一排\n四罐麥仔酒 這擺阿雄請",
